<section id="arlington"><h2>Who runs the Arlington Bagel?</h2>
<p>Billy Howell showed Greg Isenberg how he uses Grok Bot to produce a local newsletter. His public archive lets you inspect an actual issue. The interview explains his process. Each answers a different question. <a href="sources.html#O01">[O01]</a> <a href="sources.html#O02">[O02]</a></p>
