<h3>Rebuild one editorial decision</h3><p>Use the synthetic entries below as practice. A7 announces a Saturday concert at Hall East. A8 repeats A7. A9 changes the venue to Hall West. A10 advertises a sponsor without an event date.</p>
<pre><code>Prepare one local-news draft from the four entries.
Group A7 and A8 by the original announcement. Flag the venue conflict in A9.
Keep the sponsor lead outside the editorial item. Do not send or publish.
Return the source IDs, the unresolved field and the editor's next check.</code></pre>
<p><strong>Check.</strong> One editorial item cites A7, A8 and A9. Its venue needs confirmation. A10 appears only in the draft sales queue. Reject any answer that counts A8 as a second event. Advance to scheduling only after the same decision works by hand on several issues.</p>
